## Governance Policies

### Code of Conduct

| Topic | Coverage |
|-------|----------|
| Ethical Behavior | Expected standards |
| Conflicts of Interest | Disclosure, avoidance |
| Confidentiality | Information protection |
| Compliance | Legal requirements |
| Reporting | Whistleblower procedures |

### Conflict of Interest Policy

| Requirement | Process |
|-------------|---------|
| Disclosure | Annual + as arise |
| Review | General Counsel |
| Recusal | From related decisions |
| Documentation | Maintained by Legal |

### Related Party Transactions

| Threshold | Approval Required |
|-----------|-------------------|
| < $10,000 | CFO |
| $10,000 - $120,000 | CEO + CFO |
| > $120,000 | Audit Committee |
| Executive/Director | Board |

### Insider Trading Policy

| Restriction | Scope |
|-------------|-------|
| Trading Blackouts | Quarterly (pre-earnings) |
| Pre-Clearance | Directors, Officers, designated |
| 10b5-1 Plans | Permitted with approval |
| Material Nonpublic Info | No trading |

